# GED test fixture: a square pyramid (5 vertices, 6 triangles) with UVs.
# Base is the y=0 square, apex at (0,2,0). Asymmetric in Y for axis tests.
mtllib pyramid.mtl
v -1 0 -1
v 1 0 -1
v 1 0 1
v -1 0 1
v 0 2 0
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1
vt 0.5 0.5
usemtl stone
f 1/1 2/2 3/3
f 1/1 3/3 4/4
f 1/1 5/5 2/2
f 2/2 5/5 3/3
f 3/3 5/5 4/4
f 4/4 5/5 1/1
